From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: acqxi <kacqxi@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:27:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 11/15] Customized build: title marker and check-only updates

Window titles end with " (Customized)" and Settings > About shows
"(Customized)" next to the version, so this build is never mistaken for
a stock install. Titles only: productName, appId, AppUserModelId, the
userData path and updates keep the stock names.

With T3CODE_UPDATE_CHECK_ONLY set, as the customize launcher does, the
desktop keeps checking the official update feed but refuses to download
or install; T3CODE_DISABLE_AUTO_UPDATE no longer turns the check off.
A found update shows in the sidebar, in the update button's tooltip and
on the Settings version row: quit, update the official T3 Code, then run
t3code-customize.
